## Why liveness probes are so aggressive

Many components had default 1-5 second probe timeouts. On a
resource-constrained system, these need to be much more generous.
Specifically:
- calico-kube-controllers: exec probe 10s timeout, 6 failures = 60s
- csi-nfs: exec probe, very fast timeout
- Flux controllers: HTTP probe, 1s default
- kube-apiserver: HTTP probe, default times

ACTION ITEM: Patch probe timeouts for resilience. Suggested values:
- timeoutSeconds: 30 (instead of 1-5)
- periodSeconds: 30 (instead of 10)
